WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.625
So, the decisions.

2
00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:04.660
The sponsor and CIO run
this as its own program,

3
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:08.574
adopt the four-issuer target
anchored to the existing root,

4
00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:13.926
confirm the self-hosted lifecycle platform,
name a renewal owner for every class,

5
00:00:13.926 --> 00:00:19.038
approve each wave's gate, and retire each
authority only after its gate passes.

6
00:00:19.038 --> 00:00:24.149
The CISO sets lifetimes and automated
renewal, requires strong bindings,

7
00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:28.188
owns one access model, and sets
the compliance grace period.

8
00:00:28.188 --> 00:00:32.838
The PKI team classifies every template
and runs the root's revocation list

9
00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:37.563
as a production service, and with the
security team holds the hardening gate.

10
00:00:37.563 --> 00:00:41.012
The authorizing official
accepts each standing exception.

11
00:00:41.012 --> 00:00:42.701
It starts with the inventory.

12
00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:46.850
Book 07 has the detail,
every claim footnoted.

13
00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:47.660
Thank you.
